      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">More about Insurance Support</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a class="text-blue-700 underline" href="/brand/hari-kotian-insurance-advisor/">Hari Kotian — IRDAI certified insurance advisor</a><span class="text-slate-600"> — credentials, registration and areas of practice.</span></li>
